OL,3,GNEWSACity to prepare for pavement
OL,4,Aparking fines
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors have unanimously agreed
OL,7,Fsteps should be taken to ensure new
OL,8,Frestrictions against pavement parking
OL,9,Fare enforced in Hull.
OL,11,FThe Department for Transport said it
OL,12,Fplans to introduce legislation in
OL,13,FJanuary to allow councils with civil
OL,14,Fparking enforcement powers to issue
OL,15,Ffines where a vehicle unnecessarily
OL,16,Fobstructs the pavement.
OL,18,FA motion, put forward by Labour
OL,19,Fcouncillor Jessica Smith to a full Hull
OL,20,FCity Council meeting on Thursday,
OL,21,Fcalled for a dedicated task group to be
OL,22,Fset up to prepare.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
